<title>ITALY: Italy electricity January consumption down 1.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Italy electricity January consumption down 1.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's consumption of electricity in January fell 1.2 percent compared to January 1996, Italian electricity utility ENEL said in a statement.</p>
<p>ENEL added that January 1997 had some 21 working days, one less that than 22 working days in January 1996. The month-by-month change showed a fall in electricity consumption of 0.8 percent from December 1996.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
